# Some proxies (e.g. Loon on iOS with certain nodes) kill curl's default TLS
# ClientHello — the connection dies with "SSL routines::unexpected eof" before
# any data flows. Disabling ALPN (curl then speaks plain HTTP/1.1) makes it
# work reliably. Harmless elsewhere: it only means no HTTP/2 for the curl CLI.
no-alpn
